        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Seth Rollins, Colby Daniel Lopez, Dean Ambrose, Jirair S. Hovnanian\n- Organizations: WWE\n- Products: WWE Raw Tag Team Championship\n- Places: New Jersey\n- Roles: professional wrestler, actor, home builder\n\nFacts:\n- Jirair S. Hovnanian was born on June 9, 1927, and died on August 14, 2007.\n- Jirair S. Hovnanian was an Armenian Iraqi-American home builder based in New Jersey.\n- Colby Daniel Lopez was born on May 28, 1986.\n- Colby Daniel Lopez is an American professional wrestler and actor signed to WWE under the ring name Seth Rollins.\n- Seth Rollins performs on WWE's Raw brand.\n- Dean Ambrose and Seth Rollins are the current WWE Raw Tag Team Champions.\n- Dean Ambrose and Seth Rollins are in their first reign as a team.\n- Seth Rollins is one-half of the Raw brand's Tag Team Champions in his second reign as an individual and his first reign with Dean Ambrose.",
